## No-go — never contribute these

Machine-enforced. Every item is checked against this list before a pull request
is opened, and any hit blocks the contribution. Keep the entries short and
literal: this is a keyword check, not a comprehension check, and the pull
request review is what catches everything it cannot.

- salary
- compensation
- bonus
- equity grant
- medical
- diagnosis
- therapy
- bank account
- credit card
- passport
- home address
- date of birth
- password
- api key
- access token

## Review rules

How a contribution gets merged. State the minimum honestly — one approving
review from an owner is a real rule; "we all read everything" is not.

- One approving review from an owner.
- A contribution that adds a standing rule (not a fact) needs two.
- Regenerate and commit `catalog.json` in the same PR as any content change,
  so every subscriber routes this bank identically.
